  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan splits a rockman earth path grotto-heaven into the sovereign immortal aperture, a mountain range appears in Mini Central Continent. Shi San Bai excitedly names it their tribe’s Myriad Ravine Mountain Range. Shi Gua Bi answers that it is their former Sacred Mountain, now ordinary inside the sovereign immortal aperture, with a complex expression that is both dejected and happy. He is among the rockman Gu Immortals of that former grotto-heaven who were sent into the aperture in advance. Their cultivation rose rapidly and they gained many Immortal Gu. The rockman Gu Immortals fly into Myriad Ravine Mountain Range, speak to cheering rockman Gu Masters, and begin work on the mountain as an earth vein core.",
      "chapters": [
        2154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_mini_central_continent",
        "char_shi_san_bai",
        "loc_black_and_white_sacred_mountain",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shi San Bai and Shi Gua Bi had agreed to finish a mission of setting up earth path resource points. Fang Yuan then suddenly commands and dispatches several rockman Gu Immortals out of the sovereign immortal aperture, so Shi San Bai must wait for others to team up and later works with Yu Zi instead.",
      "chapters": [
        2254
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dispatched-from-the-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang clan decides to openly transact the black-yellow earth pool with Fang Yuan, Shi Gua Bi and the rest are shaken. Shi Gua Bi and the other rockman Gu Immortals feel awkward. They only have rank seven cultivation, while that super resource point is at rank eight level. Lu Wei Yin appears and says Alliance Leader Great Love already expected this, resolving their awkwardness, then handles relocating the pool with earth path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        2255
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "black-yellow-earth-pool",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
